    <preface>
      <p>Defence Service Homes Amendment (Insurance) Act 2025</p>
      <p>No. 10, 2025</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Defence Service Homes Act 1918</i> and validate certain activities and arrangements, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
      <p>3	Schedules	2</p>
      <p>Schedule 1—Amendments and validation	3</p>
      <p><ref href="#part-1">Part 1</ref>—Amendments	3</p>
